---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy | UI Forge" description="The UI Forge privacy policy.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: August 31, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-base leading-8 text-zinc-400">
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Information we collect</h2><p class="mt-3">UI Forge is designed to be browsed without an account. We do not intentionally collect personal information through the component documentation pages.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Usage data</h2><p class="mt-3">If basic analytics or hosting logs are enabled, they may record limited technical information such as browser type, approximate location, and pages requested. This information is used to maintain and improve the site.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Third-party links</h2><p class="mt-3">The site may link to GitHub or other third-party services. Their privacy practices are controlled by their own policies, so review those policies before submitting information.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Contact</h2><p class="mt-3">For privacy questions, please open an issue in the project's GitHub repository.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
